<title>NETHERLANDS: Vendex considers listing bus. services.</title>
<headline>Vendex considers listing bus. services.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail and business services group Vendex International NV said on Monday it was considering a separate listing for its business services division on the Amsterdam stock exchange.  </p>
<p>&quot;The business services group as such has enough critical mass to work seperately as a listed company. Therefore, Vendex is looking for possibilities to spin off the business services group and propose for a listing for this unit on the Amsterdam stock exchange,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Because of the intended spin-off of the business services group, Vendex is creating possibilities for a further expansion of its retail business......&quot;, it said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
